265
00:24:55,282 --> 00:24:58,978
Mi nombre... Ferruccio.

266
00:24:59,373 --> 00:25:01,857
Ferruccio Lamborghini.

267
00:25:01,958 --> 00:25:03,641
Genial.

268
00:25:03,742 --> 00:25:05,295
